  "title": "Almond Meringue Cookies",
  "description": "An old German family favorite. Meringue cookies made with almonds and spiced with cinnamon and lemon. A must for every Christmas!",
  "authors": [
    "Kristen Nicole"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T02:47:03-04:00",
